  "description": "Optional transport-agnostic control facade add-on for Orleans.Lattice multi-tenant clusters. Presents one discoverable, fail-closed control surface for the tenant lifecycle - create, suspend, resume, and delete (delete cascading the tenant's trees) - over the tenancy add-on's tenant registry. Every operation authorizes the caller through the Lattice access gate before acting, so an unauthenticated or unauthorized caller is refused. Registered separately; adds no transport behaviour of its own (the gRPC and MCP bindings adapt over it).",
